,"source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029961","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:36:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5094510-1847286114027114","game_id":"steam-5094510","kind":"update","title":"Deliwhere? - Hotfix 0.0.4 (Major Performance Fixes, Smooth FPS & UI Polish)","summary":"Hello Couriers! 🚚💨Hotfix 0.0.4 is now live! This update focuses heavily on performance smoothness, eliminating frame skipping/stuttering, improving machine interfaces, and polishing quality-of-life mechanics:⚡ PERFORMANCE & FRAME PACING (CRITICAL)• Fixed Frame Skipping & Micro-Stutters: Resolved engine-level CPU spikes and memory allocations causing sudden hitching and frame drops. Flight and hangar gameplay are now buttery smooth.🖥️ TETHERLINK & INTERFACE FIXES• Machine Interaction Visibility: ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:11:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027114","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:58:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5094510-1846651706696404","game_id":"steam-5094510","kind":"update","title":"Deliwhere? - Hotfix 0.0.3 (Multiplayer Stability, Physics & UI Polish)","summary":"Hello Couriers! 🚚💨We have just released Hotfix 0.0.3, bringing another round of stability improvements, physics adjustments, and interface polish based on your ongoing playtest feedback.Here is an overview of what's included in Hotfix 0.0.3:🛠️ MULTIPLAYER & NETWORKING • Improved shelf storage and inventory synchronization between Host and Clients. • Enhanced lobby connection handling and smoother cleanup for disconnected players. • Added occupancy safeguards for sleeping areas in cooperative pla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:44:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"http